	"data": "Smart Locks: Bluetooth-Only, No WiFi, Mechanical Key Backup\n\nResearch date: 2026-08-22\nCriteria priority: Mechanical key → No WiFi → Bluetooth phone unlock → Long battery life → HA compatible\n\nExecutive Summary\n\nThe \"Bluetooth-only, no WiFi, mechanical key backup\" profile is a narrow niche. Most smart lock makers have moved toward WiFi-included or Matter-over-Thread models. However, several viable options remain — the strongest being Yale Assure Lock 2 Bluetooth (with optional Z-Wave module for…",
